{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372450/extras/7c55f7cf97d5faa0b691df5037e8e625.avif?t=1757848863\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan out your turns to skilfully weave between bullets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress deeper, your enemies will have deadlier and more dastardly bullet patterns, so don\u2019t get overwhelmed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372450/extras/188d78dcd60ee5d9237c5f437e100b76.avif?t=1757848863\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every single weapon does something unique \u2013 Bat bullets back with a Baseball Bat, freeze enemies with an Ice Blast or even jump over bullets with a Feather!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know what you\u2019re gonna get when you smash open a weapon crate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372450/extras/6d0665dae0d497d0735f529ab4564cf8.avif?t=1757848863\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades change the way you play \u2013 Hover over bottomless pits, turn your weapons into automatic turrets or even remote control your bullets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only hold so many upgrades \u2013 choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372450/extras/c70f95b5dbcd53d720fb987e11678b30.avif?t=1757848863\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With snappy gameplay and no waiting for enemy turns, you can blast through the game at whatever pace you like \u2013 but don\u2019t forget to slow down if you need to!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2372450/extras/4297342027adf55c9b7b32d66e2ca2de.avif?t=1757848863\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep killing enemies to keep up your combo and get more coins! Each turn wasted will tick down the timer, so keep the pressure on your foes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Can You Canyon?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/91e1d8eea0f65c2ee77e1d03138ccabbf15d8a83.jpg"},{"name":"A Miner Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/8679eee122e0a73c21e67c75b0e911af7a69bf89.jpg"},{"name":"Bogged Off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/33bfa87e2f9ee9f8b61dc6f3df03fa27d3243a2e.jpg"},{"name":"Rooted Tooted Looted & Shooted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/6b6bcf7da75bec67fe71618c18a88f9e27e2e2f8.jpg"},{"name":"Bell Pepper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/ea159f570c2908e43e0d40a705142baf9ee7d40f.jpg"},{"name":"Pimento","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/f854618d58911b763025f98b8f25a5d1a6e1f218.jpg"},{"name":"Poblano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/6f5d530690442a4e97c691072d9790ce19bcf29e.jpg"},{"name":"Jalape\u00f1o","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/5a6d5b6d4e0ebf2cd060eadfa77088666ff66f67.jpg"},{"name":"Serrano","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2372450/71a42506cac4b3e14